  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The defined article",
   "texto": [
    "In Italian the article depends on how **empieza** the next word.",
    "masculine: **il** book (normal); **lo** zaino, **lo** student (in front of z or s + consonant); **l'**amico (in front of vocal).",
    "feminine: **la** house; **l'**amica (in front of vocal).",
    "Plural: **i** libri, **gli** student, **gli** amici (masculine); **le** case, **le** amiche (feminine)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "tabla",
